From 623ccacd1184d31b531bd8f08fb5e45cc1f61ecc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DrakeRamorayJr <179530612+DrakeRamorayJr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:16:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bare: keep the tab sheet open for in-sheet search on a soft
 keyboard

The keyboard top was read from the glass dialog after it had already
been shortened by the bottom inset, so every layout lifted it further
until the sheet window collapsed and the page and address bar showed
in the gap. The keyboard top is now measured on the activity decor, the
latch only moves up, and the sheet window ends on the keyboard edge.
The url bar cannot take focus while a sheet is open, and focus that
moves to it returns to the search field. Back now hides the keyboard,
then clears the search and returns to half, then closes the sheet.
